+**Pseudocode:**
+```python
+def neural_pil_forward(z_l, omega_r, b_r, mapping_net_1, mapping_net_2, film_layers):
+    # Step 3: Generate parameters for initial layers from illumination embedding
+    gamma_init, beta_init = mapping_net_1(z_l)
+    # Step 4: Decode illumination for direction
+    x = omega_r
+    for layer in film_layers[:-1]:
+        x = layer(x, gamma=gamma_init, beta=beta_init)
+    # Step 5: Generate parameters for penultimate layer from roughness
+    gamma_rough, beta_rough = mapping_net_2(b_r)
+    # Step 6: Perform light integration conditioned on roughness
+    x = film_layers[-1](x, gamma=gamma_rough, beta=beta_rough)
+    # Step 7: Output pre-integrated light
+    return x
+```
 
